      info        : "PIM Accept-RP allows administrators to restrict which multicast groups a rendezvous point (RP) serves in a PIM sparse mode domain. By default, an RP accepts all multicast groups in the 224.0.0.0/4 range. Using an access list (ACL), this feature limits join/prune message processing to specific multicast groups, enhancing control and reducing unnecessary traffic.

