v2|SS15c,NIAv2|SS29,PCI-DSSv3.2.1|7.1.2,PCI-DSSv4.0|7.2.1,PCI-DSSv4.0|7.2.2,QCSC-v1|3.2,QCSC-v1|5.2.1,QCSC-v1|5.2.2,QCSC-v1|5.2.3,QCSC-v1|6.2,QCSC-v1|8.2.1,QCSC-v1|10.2.1,QCSC-v1|11.2,QCSC-v1|13.2,SWIFT-CSCv1|5.1,TBA-FIISB|31.1,TBA-FIISB|31.4.2,TBA-FIISB|31.4.3"
