switch(config-msdp-peer)# sa-filter out access-list <acl-name>

Impact:

MSDP enhances multicast scalability by enabling cross-domain source discovery while reducing configuration complexity. Features like MD5 authentication and SA filtering improve security, optimize traffic flow, and prevent unauthorized or unnecessary data processing."
