2.1|6.1,PCI-DSSv4.0|1.2.1,PCI-DSSv4.0|1.4.1,PCI-DSSv4.0|6.3,PCI-DSSv4.0|6.3.1,QCSC-v1|3.2,QCSC-v1|5.2.1,QCSC-v1|5.2.2,QCSC-v1|5.2.3,QCSC-v1|6.2,QCSC-v1|8.2.1,QCSC-v1|10.2.1,QCSC-v1|11.2,SWIFT-CSCv1|2.6,SWIFT-CSCv1|2.7,TBA-FIISB|43.1"
